[MECHANISM]
UID: MECH-SCRIBE-MODULE-FILENAMES
TITLE: The writer's module files still carry the retired name
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The writer's command is scribe; its module files are still sdoc_cli.py and
sdoc_model.py. Renaming them restates prose in twelve nodes, three of which
must not change -- the frozen ruling, and two evidence nodes recording
measurements against those paths -- so the canon cannot be made fully
consistent by the rename and the churn buys only internal tidiness.

Mechanical and unblocking when someone wants it. sdoc_fp.py is out of scope: it
is format-side, not the writer.
<<<
